EN:
You know, {{TAG:0005:0003:}} treated me
like this. And I haven't been back to
visit. So.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}good-bye to you too!{{TAG:0007:0008:96000000}}

ES:
Oye, {{TAG:0005:0003:}} me hizo lo mismo
y no he vuelto de visita nunca más.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Si es lo que quieres... ¡adiós!{{TAG:0007:0008:96000000}}

IT:
Anche {{TAG:0005:0003:}} mi ha giocato
lo stesso tiro e me la sono legata
al dito. Ecco, ora lo sai!{{TAG:0007:0008:96000000}}

TRANSLATION:
Biliyor musun, {{TAG:0005:0003:}} da bana
böyle yapmıştı. Bir daha ziyaretine
gitmedim. Öyleyse.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:05000000}}sana da hoşça kal!{{TAG:0007:0008:96000000}}
